Package: integralARB
Title: Rigorous Numerical Integration using ARB Library
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bao Khue Tran", "bao_khue.tran@unsw.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("FLINT Contributors", role = "cph", comment = "Uses FLINT library"))
Description: Performs rigorous numerical integration using ball arithmetic with 
    mathematically guaranteed error bounds. Handles pathological functions that 
    break standard quadrature methods. Based on the FLINT/ARB library.
License: LGPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: methods
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://github.com/tranbaokhue/integralARB
BugReports: https://github.com/tranbaokhue/integralARB/issues
SystemRequirements: FLINT library (>= 3.0), GMP library, MPFR library
